WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:08.080
Today, decide whether each word carries voc and voke, calling out, or dict, saying and declaring.

00:00:08.080 --> 00:00:12.040
Then sort words by the rule that explains their spelling.

00:00:12.040 --> 00:00:14.760
Then three new lines to finish in the game.
